# Osano

> Osano is the simple, all-in-one data privacy platform that helps organizations build, manage, and scale their privacy programs. Founded in 2018 and headquartered in Austin, Texas, Osano is the first data privacy platform that is also a certified B Corporation and a Public Benefit Corporation. The platform covers consent management, subject rights (DSAR) automation, assessments, data mapping, and vendor privacy risk management, and is backed by the industry's only "No Fines. No Penalties." Guarantee. Osano helps organizations stay compliant with GDPR, CPRA/CCPA, and 95+ global privacy laws across 50+ countries.

## Platform & Products

- [The Osano Platform](https://www.osano.com/products): Overview of the simple, all-in-one data privacy platform.
- [Cookie Consent](https://www.osano.com/cookieconsent): Collect, manage, and record consent preferences with jurisdiction-aware banners for data privacy laws in 50+ countries. Osano is a Google-certified consent management platform (CMP) with support for Google Consent Mode v2.
- [Subject Rights Management](https://www.osano.com/products/subject-rights): Centralize and automate the DSAR (data subject access request) workflow.
- [Unified Consent & Preference Hub](https://www.osano.com/products/unified-consent-preference-hub): Collect and manage consent and user preferences from diverse touchpoints, including non-cookie data.
- [Data Mapping](https://www.osano.com/products/data-mapping): Automatically discover, classify, and visualize the organization's stores of personal data.
- [Vendor Privacy Risk Management](https://www.osano.com/products/vendor-risk): Evaluate and monitor vendors using Osano's privacy scores for 11,000+ companies.
- [Assessments](https://www.osano.com/products/privacy-assessments): Manage privacy assessments with pre-built (ISO, NIST) or custom templates.

## Features

- [Compliance Check](https://www.osano.com/features/compliance-check): Automated website compliance scanning for GPC signals, dark patterns, and enforcement risks.
- [TrustHub](https://www.osano.com/features/trusthub): Centralized hub for publishing and managing trust and privacy information.
- [Privacy Templates](https://www.osano.com/features/privacy-templates): Pre-built templates for privacy program documentation.
- [GDPR Representative](https://www.osano.com/features/gdpr-representative): EU/UK representative services for GDPR compliance.
- [Consult a Privacy Team](https://www.osano.com/features/privacy-experts): Access to Osano's global team of privacy experts.
- [Regulatory Guidance](https://www.osano.com/features/regulatory-guidance): Continuous monitoring and guidance on the changing privacy landscape.

